      "content": "help? what help is there? there aren't any doctors coming, and the walls are crumbling. there is no one coming to save us. it's just us, the rats, and the sound of their drums getting closer every night. i'm just so tired of waiting for the end to happen to me. i'd rather it be my choice.",
